WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.567
Patient metrics give us another wide to long example.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:10.197
Suppose one row contains heart rate, systolic blood pressure, diastolic blood pressure,

00:00:10.197 --> 00:00:13.457
and oxygen saturation in separate columns.

00:00:13.457 --> 00:00:18.117
We can un pivot those columns into two fields: metric name and metric value.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:25.654
This shape can be useful when we want to apply the same logic across several kinds of measurements.
